></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I really didn&#39;t want to waste the scraps I had cut from the puff pastry sheet so I made some little pin&nbsp;wheels with them and baked them separately, placing them on the top after baking the puff pastry pie.</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jxbyajuy":{"html":"<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:45px;\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:45px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Rainier Cherry</span></span><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:45px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;Pie</span></span></h1>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jx83q87v":{"alt":"Rainier Cherry Pie","width":4032,"height":3024,"uri":"577c92_748299102d674bf380d99801be7a6924~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg","name":"20190620_145422.jpg","containerId":"comp-jx83q87v","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_748299102d674bf380d99801be7a6924~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_450,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190620_145422.jpg","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_748299102d674bf380d99801be7a6924~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_450,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190620_145422.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_748299102d674bf380d99801be7a6924~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_900,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190620_145422.jpg 2x","css":{"container":{"position":"relative"}